1319
01:20:05,672 --> 01:20:09,242
Hi. I just moved
into the neighborhood.

1320
01:20:10,243 --> 01:20:12,045

1321
01:20:12,078 --> 01:20:15,248
A building that faces this one.
It's got a great view.

1322
01:20:15,281 --> 01:20:17,350
Sounds nice, I think.

1323
01:20:17,384 --> 01:20:19,085
You wanna come up and see it ?

1324
01:20:19,119 --> 01:20:22,355
Oh. I don't know.
We've just met.

1325
01:20:22,389 --> 01:20:24,924
I'm Bob Smoot.

1326
01:20:24,958 --> 01:20:27,027
Amanda Pierce.

1327
01:20:27,060 --> 01:20:30,363
You know, I've gotta be
honest with you,<i>Bob</i>

1328
01:20:30,397 --> 01:20:33,366
I know. Smoot is a very
strange-sounding name.

1329
01:20:33,400 --> 01:20:35,168
It's good to be honest
from the get-go.

1330
01:20:36,403 --> 01:20:38,204
So, what's your line
of work, Bob ?

1331
01:20:38,238 --> 01:20:40,240
That's funny you should ask.

1332
01:20:40,273 --> 01:20:44,044
I just got promoted to a nice, 
boring desk job with the F.B.I.

1333
01:20:44,077 --> 01:20:47,047
That's funny. You look a lot like
this guy I used to know.

1334
01:20:47,080 --> 01:20:49,482
Good guy ?
Great guy.

1335
01:20:49,516 --> 01:20:53,153
But he's not as cute as you.

1336
01:20:53,186 --> 01:20:55,288
Come on.

1337
01:20:57,424 --> 01:20:59,325
Come here. Come over here.

1338
01:21:01,461 --> 01:21:04,264
Look down there.

1339
01:21:05,365 --> 01:21:07,233

1340
01:21:07,267 --> 01:21:10,170

1341
01:21:10,203 --> 01:21:12,439
I told you that I had
a great view.

1342
01:21:12,472 --> 01:21:15,275
You know, I heard you shouldn't 
look into your neighbors' windows.

1343
01:21:15,308 --> 01:21:17,077
It only leads to trouble.

1344
01:21:17,110 --> 01:21:19,446
Well, you can't always
believe what you see.

1345
01:21:19,479 --> 01:21:22,015
A woman I used to know told me...

1346
01:21:22,048 --> 01:21:25,185
that sometimes you need
to take a deeper look.

1347
01:21:30,323 --> 01:21:32,058

1348
01:21:33,326 --> 01:21:37,497
Whoa. That's a weird feeling.

1349
01:21:37,530 --> 01:21:39,299
